WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.461 --> 00:00:04.254
♪ Standin' on the corner ♪

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:05.756
We have all come here together.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.591
Over there, Andy Warhol.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:10.219
♪ Suitcase in my hand ♪

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:14.723
We have this chance to combine
music and art and films all together.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:19.394
We're sponsoring a new band.
It's called The Velvet Underground.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:22.940
♪ And me, I'm in a rock 'n' roll band ♪

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:26.693
["There She Goes Again" playing]

00:00:27.361 --> 00:00:30.030
That was my first time in New York,
and it was appalling.

00:00:31.615 --> 00:00:33.492
This place is filthy.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:38.830
Cinema, money, parties.
It was outrageous.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.501
People came because
the cameras were running.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:44.711
They thought they could become famous.

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:48.674
At the center of it
is the exploding art world.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.135
It opened your eyes
to a lot of possibilities.

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.972
["Venus in Furs" playing]

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.640
We started getting a following.

00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:59.935
But a lot of radio stations
wouldn't play our stuff.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:04.231
The sound, not only was it new,
but it was radically different.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:06.608
We were studying natural harmonics.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.111
♪ Shiny, shiny ♪

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:11.405
Lou's music was very heavy.

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:14.867
Everything he does in that
crackly voice of his resonated.

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:17.452
♪ I am tired... ♪

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:21.540
That weirdness, it shouldn't have
existed in this space.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.667
His music sounded
like nothing else.

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:25.961
And all of a sudden,
he would stop like that,

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:28.964
and the audience
would be dead silent.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:31.550
The Velvet Underground
had hypnotized them.

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.136
♪ One, two, three ♪

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.097
♪ Anyone whoever had a heart ♪

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:39.975
Lou was always very clear
that there's no difference

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:43.103
between being a writer of the book
and a writer of the lyrics.

00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:46.815
The artist is not with society.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:47.941
He's different.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:52.321
I was interested in communicating
to people who were on the outside.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:54.948
♪ Sweet Jane ♪

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:56.783
They were going to blaze a trail...

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.411
♪ Sweet Jane ♪

00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:01.038
which eventually they did.

00:02:02.623 --> 00:02:05.876
♪ Sweet Jane ♪

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:10.589
Good evening,
we're your local Velvet Underground.

